   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="transliteration" xml:lang="pal">
            <pb xml:id="pb-1r-trl" facs="berkeley:recid:85249-34.recto_ii.jpg/full/full/0/default.jpg"/>
            <ab xml:id="MP0035_trl-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trl-p1-l1"/>ʿL hwṭʾykˈ Y̱LYDWNṭ hlṭ-wndʾṭ ʾwsṭʾndʾl nc ʾwhrmẕd-PWN-mgw
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trl-p1-l2"/>ŠRM KDB Ô W cygwn hwṭʾykˈ B-ʾp̄ʾṭʾnyh Y mdydʾl
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trl-p1-l3"/>MN hwʾdšnˈ Y L LẔNH ŠNṬ $-III-III-III PWN mdydʾlyh Y
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trl-p1-l4"/>kwm lwṭsṭʾk plmwṭˈ gwmʾlṭnˈ ẔKL LWṬH hwṭʾykˈ
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trl-p1-l5"/>pṭmʾn krṭˈ ʾYḴ hmʾy ʾMT B-ʾp̄ʾṭʾnyh ẔWẔN PWN dyn Y
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trl-p1-l6"/>wcyhšnyk ʾyṭwnˈ cygwn dʾṭ-hdybʾl gwbṭʾlyh ʿL hwṭʾykˈ
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trl-p1-l7"/>W hwṭʾykˈ ʿL L plmwṭ ʿḆYDWNty ḤṬ-š wylʾdšnˈ W pṭʾn
               <lb n="8" xml:id="trl-p1-l8"/>Y ẔK CBW lʾd ʾp̄ʾdšnˈ YḆLWNtny L PWN NPŠH ṭnˈ YḆLWNm
               <lb n="9" xml:id="trl-p1-l9"/>W wcʾlm W ẔNH nʾmk L PWN gwkʾdymwdlyhʾ Y hwṭʾkrṭ ḤṬYMWNṭ
               <lb n="10" xml:id="trl-p1-l10"/>ʿL [hwṭʾykˈ Y̱LYDWNṭ hlṭ-wndʾṭ ʾwsṭʾndʾl nc ʾwhrmẕd-PWN-mgw]
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="translation" xml:lang="en">
            <ab xml:id="MP0035_trans-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trans-p1-l1"/>A1 To the lordly Ōstāndār, born with inherited knowledge, reverence! A2 (From) Ōhrmazd-pad-moγ
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trans-p1-l2"/>A3 many greetings. B And since You, Sir, with regard to the *protection of the wine‐grower(s)
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trans-p1-l3"/>because, this year 29 (PYE = 680–681 CE), by my asking regarding wine‐growing of
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trans-p1-l4"/>the Kōm district, You ordered to commission a man (who) with You, Sir,
               <lb n="5-6" xml:id="trans-p1-l5-6"/>a contract made (saying) that any time when for *protection a duty (will be due) on (our) separated religion—so as (is) the legal advisor’s speech to You, Sir,
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trans-p1-l7"/>—You gave me order to do (this), if, because (rāy, line 8) of preparation and *duration
               <lb n="8" xml:id="trans-p1-l8"/>of that pecuniary affair, You must bring it (i.e. drahm pad dēn), (then) I personally will take (it)
               <lb n="9" xml:id="trans-p1-l9"/>and will pay. Bz And this letter, by the witnesses’ seals of Xwadāgird, I sealed.
               <lb n="10" xml:id="trans-p1-l10"/>C1 To [the lordly Ōstāndār, born with inherited knowledge, reverence! C2 Ōhrmazd-pad-moγ].
            </ab>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text>
</TEI>